			],
			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update Air, Cocoon, Mountain, and Wind submodules with latest improvements\n\nThis commit updates the Air, Cocoon, Mountain, and Wind submodules to their latest versions, integrating recent enhancements that improve dependency management, integration, and coordination across the CodeEditorLand ecosystem.\n\nKey updates include:\n- Air: Standardized dependencies to use workspace versions for consistency and added generated gRPC client/server code for remote service interactions.\n- Cocoon: Implemented bootstrap process with Mountain integration and refactored configuration service to use instance methods for better encapsulation.\n- Mountain: Refactored IPC module exports and fixed async setup issues, improving code structure and communication reliability.\n- Wind: Added comprehensive multi-agent coordination system with documentation and testing, enabling real-time synchronization and conflict resolution.\n\nThese updates strengthen the infrastructure by ensuring dependency consistency, enhancing integration between components, and advancing multi-agent coordination capabilities.",
			"SHA": "c4b55ad86120515caa21fb83d95e18486f4be34d"
		},
